ard_auth/routes.py:195-202`: password-capable providers now redirect to `/login` before `start_login()` is reached.\n- `plugins/dashboard_auth/basic/__init__.py:206,229-233` confirms `basic` is password-capable and intentionally has no OAuth `start_login()` implementation.\n- Commit `3e24b16f566045399012bc1185fe0cdb6e1a1be9` added this behavior and the regression coverage in `tests/hermes_cli/test_dashboard_auth_password_login.py:211-217`.\n\nThe discussion's duplicate reference to #55130 is consistent with this resolved behavior.\n", "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4982725943/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}]